<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="Inventory Management LLD" id="inventory">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1434" dy="844" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2200" pageHeight="1400">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        
        <!-- Title -->
        <mxCell id="title" value="INVENTORY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM - Order Management System (like Zomato/Zepto)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2120" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <!-- SECTION 1-3: CORE COMPONENTS -->
        <mxCell id="subtitle1" value="SECTION 1: PRODUCT &amp; INVENTORY MANAGEMENT" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="70" width="900" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="product" value="Product&#xa;&#xa;- productId: String&#xa;- productName: String&#xa;// NO price here!" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="120" width="180" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="productcategory" value="ProductCategory&#xa;&#xa;- categoryId: String&#xa;- categoryName: String&#xa;- products: List&lt;Product&gt;&#xa;- price: Double  // Same for all!&#xa;&#xa;+ addProduct(Product)&#xa;+ removeProduct(Product)" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="260" y="120" width="240" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="inventory" value="Inventory&#xa;&#xa;- categories: List&lt;ProductCategory&gt;&#xa;&#xa;+ addCategory(ProductCategory)&#xa;+ removeCategory(ProductCategory)&#xa;+ addProduct(category, Product)&#xa;+ removeProduct(category, Product)" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="540" y="120" width="280" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="warehouse" value="Warehouse&#xa;&#xa;- warehouseId: String&#xa;- inventory: Inventory&#xa;- address: Address&#xa;&#xa;+ addItemToInventory()&#xa;+ removeItemFromInventory()" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="860" y="120" width="240" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="warehousecontroller" value="WarehouseController&#xa;&#xa;- warehouses: List&lt;Warehouse&gt;&#xa;- selectionStrategy:&#xa;  WarehouseSelectionStrategy&#xa;&#xa;+ addWarehouse(Warehouse)&#xa;+ selectWarehouse(): Warehouse" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1140" y="120" width="280" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="strategy" value="&lt;&lt;interface&gt;&gt;&#xa;WarehouseSelectionStrategy&#xa;&#xa;+ selectWarehouse(): Warehouse&#xa;&#xa;Implementations:&#xa;- NearestWarehouseStrategy&#xa;- CheapestWarehouseStrategy" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1460" y="120" width="260" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <!-- SECTION 2: USER & CART -->
        <mxCell id="subtitle2" value="SECTION 2: USER, CART &amp; ORDER FLOW" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="340" width="900" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="user" value="User&#xa;&#xa;- userId: String&#xa;- userName: String&#xa;- cart: Cart  // 1:1 relationship&#xa;- orderIds: List&lt;String&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="390" width="200" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="cart" value="Cart&#xa;&#xa;- items: Map&lt;Integer, Integer&gt;&#xa;  // categoryId → count&#xa;  // NOT individual products!&#xa;&#xa;+ addItem(categoryId, count)&#xa;+ removeItem(categoryId)&#xa;+ viewCart()&#xa;+ emptyCart()" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="280" y="390" width="260" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="order" value="Order&#xa;&#xa;- orderId: String&#xa;- user: User&#xa;- deliveryAddress: Address&#xa;- items: Map&lt;Integer, Integer&gt;&#xa;  // Same as cart: categoryId → count&#xa;- warehouse: Warehouse&#xa;- invoice: Invoice&#xa;- payment: Payment&#xa;- orderStatus: OrderStatus" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="580" y="390" width="300" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="invoice" value="Invoice&#xa;&#xa;- totalItemPrice: Double&#xa;- totalTax: Double&#xa;- finalPrice: Double" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="920" y="390" width="180" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="payment" value="Payment&#xa;&#xa;- paymentMode: PaymentMode&#xa;&#xa;+ makePayment(): boolean&#xa;&#xa;Modes: UPI, CARD, COD" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="920" y="520" width="200" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="orderstatus" value="&lt;&lt;enum&gt;&gt;&#xa;OrderStatus&#xa;&#xa;PENDING&#xa;DELIVERED&#xa;CANCELED&#xa;RETURNED&#xa;UNDELIVERED" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1160" y="390" width="140" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <!-- SECTION 3: KEY FLOW -->
        <mxCell id="subtitle3" value="SECTION 3: ORDER FLOW ALGORITHM" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="660" width="900" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="flow" value="COMPLETE ORDER FLOW:&#xa;&#xa;1. USER SETUP&#xa;   - Create User&#xa;   - Each user automatically gets Cart (1:1)&#xa;   - UserController manages all users&#xa;&#xa;2. WAREHOUSE SETUP&#xa;   - Create Warehouse with Address&#xa;   - Create Inventory for warehouse&#xa;   - Add ProductCategory to Inventory&#xa;   - Add Products to ProductCategory&#xa;   - WarehouseController manages all warehouses&#xa;&#xa;3. SELECT WAREHOUSE FOR USER&#xa;   - User comes to app&#xa;   - warehouseController.selectWarehouse(strategy)&#xa;   - Strategy can be: NEAREST or CHEAPEST&#xa;   - ONE warehouse per user session (all products from same warehouse!)&#xa;&#xa;4. VIEW PRODUCTS&#xa;   - Get Inventory from selected Warehouse&#xa;   - Show ProductCategories (NOT individual products!)&#xa;   - User sees: 'Coca Cola 500ml - ₹50' (category with 1000 items in stock)&#xa;&#xa;5. ADD TO CART&#xa;   - User selects: categoryId=123, count=3&#xa;   - cart.addItem(123, 3)&#xa;   - Cart stores: Map&lt;categoryId, count&gt;&#xa;   - Example: {123: 3, 456: 2}  // 3 items from category 123, 2 from 456&#xa;&#xa;6. PLACE ORDER&#xa;   - orderController.placeOrder(user, warehouse)&#xa;   - Create new Order&#xa;   - Copy cart items to order.items&#xa;   - Generate Invoice (calculate price from ProductCategory.price × count)&#xa;   - Set order.warehouse = selected warehouse&#xa;   - Add orderId to user.orderIds&#xa;&#xa;7. CHECKOUT&#xa;   - order.checkout()&#xa;   - Step 1: UPDATE INVENTORY&#xa;     • For each (categoryId, count) in order.items:&#xa;       - Get ProductCategory from warehouse.inventory&#xa;       - Remove 'count' products from category.products list&#xa;   - Step 2: MAKE PAYMENT&#xa;     • payment.makePayment()  // UPI/Card/COD&#xa;     • If payment SUCCESS:&#xa;       - cart.emptyCart()  // Clear user's cart&#xa;       - orderStatus = DELIVERED&#xa;     • If payment FAILED:&#xa;       - Add items back to inventory (rollback)&#xa;       - orderStatus = PENDING&#xa;&#xa;8. PAYMENT TIMEOUT / FAILURE HANDLING&#xa;   - If payment timeout:&#xa;     • addItemsBackToInventory(order.items)&#xa;     • Iterate warehouse.inventory&#xa;     • For each category, add products back&#xa;   - Cart remains as-is until payment succeeds&#xa;&#xa;KEY DESIGN DECISIONS:&#xa;&#xa;✓ WHY CategoryId → Count instead of individual products?&#xa;  - 1000 Coca Cola bottles look identical&#xa;  - Don't show 1000 separate items to user&#xa;  - User just says 'I want 3 Coca Colas'&#xa;  - Efficient storage &amp; retrieval&#xa;&#xa;✓ WHY Cart belongs to User (composition)?&#xa;  - One user = One cart (always)&#xa;  - Cart lifecycle tied to user&#xa;  - No orphan carts&#xa;&#xa;✓ WHY Warehouse Selection Strategy?&#xa;  - Nearest warehouse → faster delivery&#xa;  - Cheapest warehouse → lower cost&#xa;  - User preference decides&#xa;  - Extensible: add FASTEST, MOST_STOCK, etc.&#xa;&#xa;✓ WHY Order has User (not User has Orders)?&#xa;  - Order is independent entity&#xa;  - Order Management System focuses on Order&#xa;  - User just keeps orderIds for reference&#xa;  - Can query OrderController.getOrdersByUser(userId)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Courier New;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="710" width="1260" height="960" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <!-- SECTION 4: ER DIAGRAM -->
        <mxCell id="title_er" value="SECTION 4: ER DIAGRAM" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1360" y="660" width="800" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="er_product" value="Product&#xa;&#xa;PK  productId: INT&#xa;    productName: VARCHAR(200)" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=left;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1360" y="720" width="220" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="er_category" value="ProductCategory&#xa;&#xa;PK  categoryId: INT&#xa;    categoryName: VARCHAR(200)&#xa;    price: DECIMAL(10,2)" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=left;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1620" y="720" width="240" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="er_catproduct" value="CategoryProduct (M:N)&#xa;&#xa;PK  id: INT&#xa;FK  categoryId: INT&#xa;FK  productId: INT" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=left;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1900" y="720" width="220" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="er_inventory" value="Inventory&#xa;&#xa;PK  inventoryId: INT&#xa;FK  warehouseId: INT" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=left;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1360" y="860" width="220" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="er_warehouse" value="Warehouse&#xa;&#xa;PK  warehouseId: INT&#xa;FK  inventoryId: INT&#xa;FK  addressId: INT" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=left;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1620" y="860" width="200" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="er_user" value="User&#xa;&#xa;PK  userId: INT&#xa;    userName: VARCHAR(100)&#xa;FK  cartId: INT" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=left;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1360" y="1000" width="200" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="er_cart" value="Cart&#xa;&#xa;PK  cartId: INT&#xa;FK  userId: INT" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=left;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1600" y="1000" width="160" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="er_cartitem" value="CartItem&#xa;&#xa;PK  id: INT&#xa;FK  cartId: INT&#xa;FK  categoryId: INT&#xa;    count: INT" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=left;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1800" y="1000" width="180" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="er_order" value="Order&#xa;&#xa;PK  orderId: INT&#xa;FK  userId: INT&#xa;FK  warehouseId: INT&#xa;FK  invoiceId: INT&#xa;FK  paymentId: INT&#xa;FK  addressId: INT&#xa;    orderStatus: ENUM&#xa;    createdAt: DATETIME" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=left;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1360" y="1180" width="220" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="er_orderitem" value="OrderItem&#xa;&#xa;PK  id: INT&#xa;FK  orderId: INT&#xa;FK  categoryId: INT&#xa;    count: INT" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=left;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1620" y="1180" width="180" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="er_invoice" value="Invoice&#xa;&#xa;PK  invoiceId: INT&#xa;    totalItemPrice: DECIMAL&#xa;    totalTax: DECIMAL&#xa;    finalPrice: DECIMAL" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=left;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1840" y="1180" width="220" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="er_payment" value="Payment&#xa;&#xa;PK  paymentId: INT&#xa;    paymentMode: VARCHAR(50)&#xa;    status: ENUM&#xa;    timestamp: DATETIME" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=left;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1360" y="1420" width="220" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <!-- SECTION 7: SCENARIO QUESTIONS -->
        <mxCell id="title_scenario" value="SECTION 7: SCENARIO QUESTIONS" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1360" y="1600" width="800" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="scenario" value="Q1: Why use categoryId → count map in Cart instead of storing individual product objects?&#xa;A1: Efficiency &amp; UX. 1000 identical Coca Cola bottles → user sees ONE category 'Coca Cola 500ml', selects count=3. Cart stores {categoryId: 123, count: 3}. Avoids showing 1000 duplicate items, reduces memory, faster cart operations. ProductCategory.products.size() shows stock availability.&#xa;&#xa;Q2: Payment timeout after inventory update. How to rollback?&#xa;A2: Checkout flow: (1) Update inventory first (remove items). (2) Make payment. If payment FAILS/TIMEOUT: addItemsBackToInventory(order.items) — iterate warehouse.inventory.categories, add 'count' products back to matching category. Transactional behavior: either both succeed or rollback.&#xa;&#xa;Q3: User adds 5 items from Cart but only 3 in stock. How to handle?&#xa;A3: During addToCart, check availability: warehouse.inventory.getCategory(categoryId).products.size() >= count. If insufficient, show error: 'Only 3 available'. Alternative: allow add but validate at checkout — if stock insufficient, remove from cart &amp; notify user before payment.&#xa;&#xa;Q4: Multiple users ordering same product concurrently. Race condition on inventory?&#xa;A4: Use optimistic locking: Add 'version' field to ProductCategory. Before removing products, check version. If changed (another user modified), retry or fail gracefully. Alternative: pessimistic locking with synchronized block or database row-level locks during checkout. Queue-based processing for high contention.&#xa;&#xa;Q5: Why Strategy Pattern for Warehouse Selection? When to use NEAREST vs CHEAPEST?&#xa;A5: Strategy Pattern allows runtime selection. NEAREST: low delivery time (geolocation-based, Haversine distance). CHEAPEST: warehouse with lowest operational cost (delivery fee). User preference or business rules decide. Extensible: add FASTEST (current traffic), MOST_STOCK (availability-based), without changing WarehouseController." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Courier New;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1360" y="1660" width="800" height="440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
